			<div class="content" id="post-content-1969243">
									

<p>I've noticed that there are alot of pathogenic SCP's and this one is especially interesting. I know that cross testing SCP's can be very unsuccessful but I've read some pretty good ones. For instance, SCP-187. There was an experiment log where she was placed in the prescence of other SCP's and that opened up some pretty interesting ideas about the other SCP's.</p>

